<title>FINLAND: AMER APPOINTS MELGIN AS NEW CORP TREASURER.</title>
<headline>AMER APPOINTS MELGIN AS NEW CORP TREASURER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sport goods group Amer-yhtyma Oy said in a statement on Monday it had appointed Jari Melgin, financial director at engineering group Santasalo-JOT Oy , as corporate treasurer from June 1.  </p>
<p>Melgin will report to Amer CFO Pekka Paalanne, Amer said.</p>
<p>Santasalo-JOT released its own statement about Melgin's move and said it would release information about its new financial director later. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
